# Transitive, and named here anyway (#152). aiohttp arrives through litellm and
# slack-sdk, so nothing in this repo chose its version -- and the 3.14 line is
# where a batch of request-smuggling and redirect credential-leak fixes landed.
# A floor on a dependency nobody declared is the only way to say "not below
# this" about a package we do not import directly.
